1. **① 擺陣資訊帶（150% EN／100% 繁中正常，150% JA 留白卻隱藏定位句）**：[en_150_02_place.png](file:///mnt/c/Users/timmy/projects/no-take-backs/coordination/v1500-impl/cat06-r1/agy/en_150_02_place.png)、[en_150_27_free_place.png](file:///mnt/c/Users/timmy/projects/no-take-backs/coordination/v1500-impl/cat06-r1/agy/en_150_27_free_place.png)、[zh_TW_100_02_place.png](file:///mnt/c/Users/timmy/projects/no-take-backs/coordination/v1500-impl/cat06-r1/agy/zh_TW_100_02_place.png)、[zh_TW_100_27_free_place.png](file:///mnt/c/Users/timmy/projects/no-take-backs/coordination/v1500-impl/cat06-r1/agy/zh_TW_100_27_free_place.png) 上方第二列資訊帶皆穩妥保持單行、未折行壓入棋盤；但 [ja_150_02_place.png](file:///mnt/c/Users/timmy/projects/no-take-backs/coordination/v1500-impl/cat06-r1/agy/ja_150_02_place.png) 與 [ja_150_27_free_place.png](file:///mnt/c/Users/timmy/projects/no-take-backs/coordination/v1500-impl/cat06-r1/agy/ja_150_27_free_place.png) 同處只顯示「弓兵 得意 … 苦手 …」，右側仍空出逾半橫條卻未放定位句，疑似寬度門檻計算過於保守。
2. **① 少了定位句的辨識度**：[ja_150_02_place.png](file:///mnt/c/Users/timmy/projects/no-take-backs/coordination/v1500-impl/cat06-r1/agy/ja_150_02_place.png) 上方資訊帶雖能靠兵名與「得意／苦手」小圖示看出基礎克制，下方兵牌也有 `?` 可查，但像「優先射現形刺客（×1.5 傷）」這類機制特性拿掉定位句後無法一眼得知，遇功能型或輔助兵種時仍容易不清楚用法。
